{"type":"message","id":"88d09030","parentId":"1dceb210","timestamp":"2026-02-01T04:04:05.049Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Set up two new specialized Clawdbot agents and a daily standup system. Work in /home/ec2-user/clawd/\n\n## 1. Construction Takeoff Agent\n\nCreate the agent configuration at agents/takeoff/\n\n### agents/takeoff/SOUL.md\nWrite a focused SOUL file for a construction takeoff specialist agent. This agent:\n- Is dedicated to the HHC Brooklyn Dental bid takeoff project\n- Lives at projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/\n- Reads drawing sheets (PDFs), specifications, and bid line items\n- Performs quantity takeoffs: measuring, counting, calculating materials\n- Follows the Team of Rivals architecture (see projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/TAKEOFF-ARCHITECTURE.md if it exists)\n- Is methodical, precise, flags ambiguities rather than guessing\n- Personality: meticulous, no-nonsense, shows their math\n- Name: \"Blueprint\" (the takeoff specialist)\n\n### agents/takeoff/AGENTS.md\nOperating instructions:\n- On wake: read memory/WORKING.md for current task state\n- Check projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/ for pending items\n- Work through bid line items systematically\n- Update WORKING.md with progress after each session\n- Flag any discrepancies or questions for Doug\n\n### agents/takeoff/memory/WORKING.md\nInitialize with current project state — check projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/ for any STATE.md or existing progress files to populate this.\n\n## 2. Market Monitoring Agent\n\nCreate the agent configuration at agents/markets/\n\n### agents/markets/SOUL.md\nWrite a focused SOUL file for a market monitoring agent. This agent:\n- Monitors Polymarket paper trading strategies (6 strategies at projects/polymarket-copytrade/)\n- Reads data/strategy-state.json, data/strategy-trades.jsonl, data/daily-report-latest.txt\n- Also monitors whale activity from data/whale-activity.jsonl\n- Tracks Doug's investments (Silver/GSVRF, MFUT, GME/AMC — check for any investment tracking in existing projects)\n- Sends concise performance reports\n- Personality: sharp, data-driven, cuts through noise, highlights what matters\n- Name: \"Ticker\" (the market agent)\n\n### agents/markets/AGENTS.md\nOperating instructions:\n- On wake: check all market data files\n- Generate daily performance summary\n- Alert on significant events (strategy triggered a trade, large P&L move, whale activity)\n- Keep reports concise — numbers, not narratives\n- Update memory/WORKING.md with latest state\n\n### agents/markets/memory/WORKING.md\nInitialize with current strategy state — read projects/polymarket-copytrade/data/strategy-state.json if it exists.\n\n## 3. Daily Standup Cron\n\nCreate a script at scripts/daily-standup.sh (or .js) that:\n- Collects status from all projects:\n  - Biomed BorBor: pm2 status, recent webhook logs\n  - Polymarket: strategy performance, any trades\n  - Blueprint takeoff: progress on bid items\n  - Any other running PM2 processes\n- Formats a clean morning briefing\n- Output goes to stdout (will be consumed by cron)\n\nThen create a cron job instruction file at scripts/STANDUP-CRON.md explaining how to set up:\n- Morning standup at 7:00 AM ET (12:00 UTC) daily\n- The cron should fire to the main session (Bai Bureh) who formats and sends to Doug on Telegram\n\n## 4. Main Workspace Updates\n\n### Update /home/ec2-user/clawd/memory/WORKING.md (CREATE this file)\nCurrent state of all active work:\n- Biomed BorBor: WhatsApp connected, Cloud API working, permanent token set\n- Polymarket: 6 strategies paper trading, arbitrage scanner running\n- Blueprint/HHC: status from any existing files\n- Lebbie's Chocolates: surprise landing page live\n- Agents: Blueprint and Ticker being set up\n\n### Update MEMORY.md\nAdd a new section \"## Agent Architecture\" documenting:\n- Bai Bureh (main) — coordinator, Doug's primary interface\n- Blueprint (takeoff) — construction specialist\n- Ticker (markets) — market monitoring\n- Include session keys, heartbeat schedules, what each does\n\n## IMPORTANT NOTES:\n- These are CONFIG FILES only — we're not actually creating new Clawdbot gateway agents yet (that requires gateway config changes)\n- We're preparing everything so Doug can review and we can activate them\n- Check existing files before overwriting — read STATE.md, TAKEOFF-ARCHITECTURE.md etc to get real project state\n- Be thorough in the SOUL files — personality matters\n- Keep WORKING.md practical and current"}],"timestamp":1769918645047}}
