{"type":"message","id":"4d4f8acc","parentId":"bf59ace9","timestamp":"2026-02-01T04:04:17.312Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01WnkGjvG9uuyYWBLMBU98bs","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Takeoff Checklist — HHC South Brooklyn Health Dental Suite 5th Floor\n## Project #26202103 | Cross-Reference of Bid Breakdown vs Drawing Data\n\n**Generated from:** bid_breakdown.json (298 items), room_schedule.json, finish_schedule.json, door_schedule.json, partition_schedule.json, scope_analysis.md  \n**Status:** ⚠️ Many quantities still blank in bid breakdown — this checklist identifies what data we have and what's missing.\n\n---\n\n## LEGEND\n- ✅ = Data available from drawings\n- ⚠️ = Partial data / needs verification\n- ❌ = No data extracted yet — needs manual takeoff\n- 🔴 = Discrepancy or flag\n\n---\n\n## 1. GENERAL CONDITIONS & OVERHEAD (Items 1-7)\n\n| Item | Description | Unit | Drawing Data | Status |\n|------|-------------|------|-------------|--------|\n| 1 | Bonds | LS | N/A — cost item | ✅ |\n| 2 | Insurance | LS | N/A — cost item | ✅ |\n| 3 | Temporary Walkoff Mats | EA | N/A — means & methods | ✅ |\n| 4 | Temporary Sticky Mats | EA | N/A — means & methods | ✅ |\n| 5 | Dust Control HEPA Filters | LS | N/A — means & methods | ✅ |\n| 6 | Project Supervision | MO | N/A — schedule-driven | ✅ |\n| 7 | Hazmat Abatement | LS | 🔴 **UNKNOWN SCOPE** — no abatement survey in drawings. Old hospital = high ACM risk. | ⚠️ |\n\n---\n\n## 2. EXISTING CONDITIONS / DEMOLITION (Items 8-23)\n\n| Item | Description | Unit | Drawing Data | Status |\n|------|-------------|------|-------------|--------|\n| 8 | Demo Interior Partitions | SF | Demo plan DM-100.00 (part3/p10) available. Need linear footage × height measurement. | ❌ |\n| 9 | Demo Floor Finishes (VCT, adhesive, base, saddles) | SF | Demo plan available. Approximate suite area ~3,500-4,000 SF total. | ⚠️ |\n| 10 | Demo Ceiling Finishes (ACT & GWB) | SF | Demo RCP DM-200.00 (part3/p11) available. | ❌ |\n| 11 | R&R Ceilings Floor Below (10% replace) | SF | 4th floor RCP A-201.00 (part3/p15) available. | ❌ |\n| 12 | Demo Single Doors | EA | Demo plan should show doors to remove. | ❌ |\n| 13 | Demo Millwork | LF | Demo plan should show. | ❌ |"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":38,"aggregated":"# Takeoff Checklist — HHC South Brooklyn Health Dental Suite 5th Floor\n## Project #26202103 | Cross-Reference of Bid Breakdown vs Drawing Data\n\n**Generated from:** bid_breakdown.json (298 items), room_schedule.json, finish_schedule.json, door_schedule.json, partition_schedule.json, scope_analysis.md  \n**Status:** ⚠️ Many quantities still blank in bid breakdown — this checklist identifies what data we have and what's missing.\n\n---\n\n## LEGEND\n- ✅ = Data available from drawings\n- ⚠️ = Partial data / needs verification\n- ❌ = No data extracted yet — needs manual takeoff\n- 🔴 = Discrepancy or flag\n\n---\n\n## 1. GENERAL CONDITIONS & OVERHEAD (Items 1-7)\n\n| Item | Description | Unit | Drawing Data | Status |\n|------|-------------|------|-------------|--------|\n| 1 | Bonds | LS | N/A — cost item | ✅ |\n| 2 | Insurance | LS | N/A — cost item | ✅ |\n| 3 | Temporary Walkoff Mats | EA | N/A — means & methods | ✅ |\n| 4 | Temporary Sticky Mats | EA | N/A — means & methods | ✅ |\n| 5 | Dust Control HEPA Filters | LS | N/A — means & methods | ✅ |\n| 6 | Project Supervision | MO | N/A — schedule-driven | ✅ |\n| 7 | Hazmat Abatement | LS | 🔴 **UNKNOWN SCOPE** — no abatement survey in drawings. Old hospital = high ACM risk. | ⚠️ |\n\n---\n\n## 2. EXISTING CONDITIONS / DEMOLITION (Items 8-23)\n\n| Item | Description | Unit | Drawing Data | Status |\n|------|-------------|------|-------------|--------|\n| 8 | Demo Interior Partitions | SF | Demo plan DM-100.00 (part3/p10) available. Need linear footage × height measurement. | ❌ |\n| 9 | Demo Floor Finishes (VCT, adhesive, base, saddles) | SF | Demo plan available. Approximate suite area ~3,500-4,000 SF total. | ⚠️ |\n| 10 | Demo Ceiling Finishes (ACT & GWB) | SF | Demo RCP DM-200.00 (part3/p11) available. | ❌ |\n| 11 | R&R Ceilings Floor Below (10% replace) | SF | 4th floor RCP A-201.00 (part3/p15) available. | ❌ |\n| 12 | Demo Single Doors | EA | Demo plan should show doors to remove. | ❌ |\n| 13 | Demo Millwork | LF | Demo plan should show. | ❌ |","cwd":"/home/ec2-user/clawd"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1769918657311}}
