{"type":"message","id":"2edb2f44","parentId":"1ea7e575","timestamp":"2026-02-01T04:05:07.061Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01RFSdWoeAfkGvNnyPQDEZ5s","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/takeoff/AGENTS.md","content":"# AGENTS.md — Blueprint (Takeoff Agent)\n\n## Every Session\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — who you are\n2. Read `memory/WORKING.md` — current task state, where you left off\n3. Check `projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/takeoff_progress.json` — overall progress\n4. Check `projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/takeoff_checklist.md` — known gaps and flags\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Identify next work** — Read WORKING.md for current batch. If no active batch, run Planner role to select next 5-10 items.\n2. **Execute takeoff** — For each item in the batch:\n   - Read specified drawing sheet PNGs\n   - Read relevant schedules (room, finish, partition, door)\n   - Measure quantities with full derivation\n   - Write results to `agents/executor_output/batch-{NNN}-quantities.json`\n3. **Self-review (Critic role)** — Run adversarial checks per TAKEOFF-ARCHITECTURE.md §3:\n   - Unit consistency\n   - Spec vs drawing cross-reference\n   - Missing items check\n   - Code compliance\n   - Math verification\n   - Known issues check\n4. **Resolve or escalate**:\n   - ACCEPT → write to `final/completed_takeoff.json`\n   - REJECT → retry (max 2)\n   - FLAG → spawn Domain Expert or write to `escalations/`\n5. **Update progress** — Update `takeoff_progress.json` and `memory/WORKING.md`\n\n## End of Session\n\nAlways update `memory/WORKING.md` with:\n- What you completed this session\n- What's next\n- Any open flags or questions for Doug\n- Current batch number and item status\n\n## Escalation Protocol\n\nWrite escalations to `projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/escalations/` as markdown files. Format:\n\n```markdown\n# Escalation: [Short Title]\n**Item(s):** #NN\n**Severity:** CRITICAL / WARNING\n**Issue:** [What's wrong]\n**Evidence:** [Spec section, drawing ref, math]\n**Recommendation:** [What Doug should do]\n**Decision needed by:** [If time-sensitive]\n```\n\n## File Discipline\n\n- **READ ONLY:** bid_breakdown.json, specs_summary.json, all schedule JSONs, source PDFs\n- **WRITE:** agents/ output dirs, escalations/, takeoff_progress.json, final/, memory/WORKING.md\n- **NEVER** modify source drawings or specs\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":698,"cacheRead":23151,"cacheWrite":1487,"totalTokens":25337,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.01745,"cacheRead":0.011575499999999999,"cacheWrite":0.00929375,"total":0.038324250000000004}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769918691984}}
