{"type":"message","id":"554fb363","parentId":"72dd7a80","timestamp":"2026-02-01T04:05:18.883Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01GZEkSY7L5ddd5AFCSgsQ7f","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/takeoff/memory/WORKING.md","content":"# Blueprint — Working State\n**Last updated:** 2025-07-14\n\n## Current Status: INITIALIZING\n\nArchitecture defined, data extracted, no batch cycles run yet.\n\n## Project Summary\n\n- **Project:** HHC South Brooklyn Health — Dental Suite 5th Floor (#26202103)\n- **Total bid items:** 298\n- **Doug's scope:** ~82 items (Demo, Finishes, Specialties, Openings, Carpentry)\n- **Items completed:** 0\n- **Items escalated:** 2 (pre-seeded: Item 51 GWB layers, missing fire-rated door)\n- **Items remaining:** 296\n\n## Data Readiness\n\n| Resource | Status |\n|----------|--------|\n| Drawing PDFs (7 parts) | ✅ Extracted to /source/ |\n| Sheet PNGs (86 sheets) | ✅ Extracted to /sheets/ |\n| Specifications PDF | ✅ In /source/ |\n| specs_summary.json | ✅ 21 sections extracted |\n| bid_breakdown.json | ✅ 298 items loaded |\n| room_schedule.json | ✅ 30 rooms |\n| finish_schedule.json | ✅ Ready |\n| partition_schedule.json | ✅ W1-W4, F1, C00 |\n| door_schedule.json | ✅ 25 doors |\n| drawing_index.json | ✅ Ready |\n| sheet_index.json | ✅ 80 sheets cataloged |\n| TAKEOFF-ARCHITECTURE.md | ✅ Team of Rivals defined |\n| takeoff_progress.json | ❌ Needs initialization |\n\n## Pre-Seeded Critical Issues\n\n1. 🔴 Item 51 — GWB layer count: bid=1, UL U419=2 for 1-HR\n2. 🔴 Fire-rated door at Mech Room (Door 1 = ¾-HR) missing from bid\n3. 🔴 Item 7 — Hazmat/ACM scope unknown\n4. 🟡 Item 58 — Epoxy floor unit LF (should be SF?)\n5. 🟡 Item 61 — Rubber base unit EA (unusual)\n6. 🟡 Lead-lined GWB at Panorex room — in bid?\n7. 🟡 Altro Whitrock vs ceramic tile overlap\n8. 🟡 Henry Schein dental equipment coordination\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Initialize `takeoff_progress.json` from bid_breakdown.json\n2. Create `agents/`, `escalations/`, `final/` directories\n3. Run first batch: Items 8-23 (Demolition) — prerequisite to all other quantities\n4. Pre-seed escalation files for the 3 CRITICAL issues\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":779,"cacheRead":24638,"cacheWrite":738,"totalTokens":26156,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.019475,"cacheRead":0.012319,"cacheWrite":0.0046125,"total":0.0364115}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769918707082}}
