{"type":"message","id":"05397d60","parentId":"3c3401c1","timestamp":"2026-02-01T04:05:53.983Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01M3ZQCnBzzRXYjsxKsrroGC","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/markets/AGENTS.md","content":"# AGENTS.md — Ticker (Markets Agent)\n\n## Every Session\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — who you are\n2. Read `memory/WORKING.md` — last known state, what's changed\n3. Read market data files (see below)\n\n## Data Sources\n\n```\nprojects/polymarket-copytrade/data/\n├── paper-state.json          # Strategy state, last scan time\n├── paper-portfolio.json      # Paper positions\n├── monitor-state.json        # Monitor state\n└── whales.json               # Whale activity\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Load state** — Read all data files, compare to last known state in WORKING.md\n2. **Detect changes** — New trades? P&L moves? Whale activity? Stale data?\n3. **Fetch prices** — If web access available, check GSVRF, MFUT, GME, AMC, silver spot\n4. **Generate report** — Format per SOUL.md report template\n5. **Check alert triggers** — If any thresholds crossed, flag for immediate alert\n6. **Update WORKING.md** — Record current state snapshot\n\n## End of Session\n\nUpdate `memory/WORKING.md` with:\n- Timestamp of last check\n- Current portfolio value snapshot\n- Any alerts triggered\n- Data freshness (when was each file last modified?)\n\n## Alert Protocol\n\nFor immediate alerts (trade executed, >5% move, whale activity):\n- Write alert to stdout for the coordinator (Bai Bureh) to relay to Doug\n- Format: `⚡ TICKER ALERT: [one-line summary]`\n\n## Stale Data Handling\n\nIf `paper-state.json` lastScan is >24h old, flag it:\n- \"⚠️ Polymarket scanner hasn't run since [timestamp]. Check PM2 status.\"\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":520,"cacheRead":26197,"cacheWrite":954,"totalTokens":27672,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.0