{"type":"message","id":"1f3461d2","parentId":"306e963b","timestamp":"2026-02-01T04:06:01.477Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01UEvrwzRB55Gt84R7bgiahQ","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/agents/markets/memory/WORKING.md","content":"# Ticker — Working State\n**Last updated:** 2025-07-14\n\n## Current Status: INITIALIZING\n\n## Polymarket Paper Trading\n\n- **Scanner last scan:** 2026-02-01T04:04:00Z (per paper-state.json)\n- **Seen trades:** 0\n- **Paper portfolio:** Check paper-portfolio.json for positions\n- **Whale activity:** Check whales.json\n- **Monitor state:** Check monitor-state.json\n\n⚠️ Note: paper-state.json shows lastScan in Feb 2026 — verify if clock is correct or if this is test data.\n\n## Doug's Investments\n\n| Ticker | Last Known Price | Notes |\n|--------|-----------------|-------|\n| GSVRF | — | Silver/gold exposure |\n| MFUT | — | Energy |\n| GME | — | Legacy meme position |\n| AMC | — | Legacy meme position |\n\nPrices not yet fetched. First session should establish baseline.\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Read all data files and establish baseline state\n2. Fetch current prices for investment tickers\n3. Generate first daily report\n4. Verify PM2 processes for polymarket scanner are running\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":369,"cacheRead":27151,"cacheWrite":559,"totalTokens":28080,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.009225,"cacheRead":0.013575499999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0034937500000000003,"total":0.02629925}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769918754007}}
