{"type":"message","id":"b578d3c8","parentId":"f3bd666e","timestamp":"2026-02-01T04:06:54.365Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01WuPLYtG66NZiJs39Zxgy62","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/memory/WORKING.md","content":"# Main Workspace — Working State\n**Last updated:** 2025-07-14\n\n## Active Projects\n\n### 🏥 Biomed BorBor\n- **Status:** WhatsApp connected, Cloud API working, permanent token set\n- **Stack:** Node.js webhook → WhatsApp Cloud API\n- **Location:** projects/biomed-bot/\n- **PM2:** Check `pm2 status` for current process health\n\n### 📊 Polymarket Copy-Trading\n- **Status:** 6 strategies paper trading, scanner running\n- **Data:** projects/polymarket-copytrade/data/\n- **Last scan:** 2026-02-01T04:04:00Z (verify clock)\n- **Trades seen:** 0 (paper mode)\n- **Location:** projects/polymarket-copytrade/\n\n### 🏗️ Blueprint / HHC Brooklyn Dental\n- **Status:** Architecture defined (Team of Rivals), data extracted, no batch cycles run\n- **Project:** HHC South Brooklyn Health — Dental Suite 5th Floor (#26202103)\n- **Bid items:** 298 total, ~82 in Doug's scope\n- **Completed:** 0 items\n- **Escalated:** 2 pre-seeded (GWB layers, missing fire door)\n- **Location:** projects/blueprint/hhc-brooklyn-dental/\n- **Next:** Initialize takeoff_progress.json, run first batch (Items 8-23, Demolition)\n\n### 🍫 Lebbie's Chocolates\n- **Status:** Surprise landing page live\n- **Location:** projects/lebbie-chocolates/\n\n### 📊 Bureh Dashboard\n- **Status:** Running on PM2\n- **Stack:** React + TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind\n- **Location:** projects/bureh-dashboard/\n\n### 🤖 Agent Architecture (NEW)\n- **Status:** Config files prepared, awaiting activation\n- **Blueprint (takeoff):** agents/takeoff/ — construction takeoff specialist\n- **Ticker (markets):** agents/markets/ — market monitoring\n- **Standup script:** scripts/daily-standup.sh — morning briefing generator\n- **Next:** Doug reviews configs, then gateway activation\n\n## Dormant Projects\n\n- **JOC Translator** — Revival planned, landing page + demo\n- **MedTech Bot** — Concept note done\n- **Haven** — Sector report complete, no active dev\n- **Sasha Job Search** — projects/sasha-job-search/\n- **LaMore Consulting** — projects/lamore-consulting/\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":696,"cacheRead":30024,"cacheWrite":632,"totalTokens":31353,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.017400000000000002,"cacheRead":0.015012,"cacheWrite":0.00395,"total":0.036367000000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1769918799399}}
